# DESK31 item 2 -- `STILLDIR`, the alert EmuTOS raises when the source of a
# copy/move is a parent of its destination (`source_is_parent`,
# deskdir.c:998-1004).  NewTOS silently set `ok = false` there until DESK31.
#
# Reaching it needs a source and a destination that are NOT the same object:
# a drop on the dragged item itself is cancelled one layer higher
# (`act_bdown`: "if ((wh == dst_wh) && (*pdobj == sobj)) dst_wh = NIL",
# deskact.c:666-670 -- confirmed by the first attempt at this gesture, which
# did nothing at all).  So:
#
#   1. open the C:\ window
#   2. drag the SUB folder onto the desktop surface -> a FOLDER shortcut
#      (DESK30, `#V`), whose `a_pappl` is C:\SUB
#   3. drag the SUB folder out of the window onto that shortcut
#
# `fun_file2desk`'s AT_ISFOLD arm makes the destination C:\SUB\, so `dir_op`
# sees srcpth C:\SUB and dstpth C:\SUB\SUB -> `source_is_parent` -> STILLDIR.
#
#   B_WIN1       the C:\ window open
#   C_SHORTCUT   the SUB folder shortcut on the desktop
#   D_CPYDEL     the ADCPYDEL "COPY FILE(S)" confirmation, which comes first
#   E_STILLDIR   the STILLDIR alert
#   F_SKIPPED    its *Skip* taken -- the walk continues, nothing is copied
#
# Coordinates from the probe run: C: (38,35); 'SUB' in window 1 (515,103); the
# free desktop cell below the window (220,449) (the DESK30 run's).  The two
# boxes' buttons come from this run's own [dlg]/[alert] dumps.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1600 move 38 35
1800 down
1803 up
1810 down
1813 up
2400 move 600 240
3200 mark B_WIN1
3600 move 515 103
4000 down
4100 drag 250 458
4700 up
5000 move 600 300
5800 mark C_SHORTCUT
6200 move 515 103
6600 down
6603 up
7000 move 515 103
7400 down
7500 drag 400 300
7900 drag 220 449
8400 up
8700 move 600 300
9800 mark D_CPYDEL
# -- OK the copy box (229,301 from this run's [dlg] dump); STILLDIR follows.
10200 move 229 301
10600 down
10800 up
11400 parkbr
12600 mark E_STILLDIR
# -- Skip (276,269 from this run's [alert] dump): the walk goes on, and with
#    SUB the only selected item there is nothing left to copy.
13000 move 276 269
13400 down
13600 up
14200 parkbr
15400 mark F_SKIPPED
